{"metadata":{"title":"Receiving credentials","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and look after them once they’re held."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus"],"title":"Receiving credentials","anchor":"Receiving-credentials","generated":true}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer offers credentials with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" link,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a QR code or a link the holder opens. Register the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so links"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open the app, and hand the link to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startIssuance(offer:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resolves the offer and the issuer’s metadata, and returns an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/offer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you show the holder: who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offering what."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The offer names one of two grants:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Authorization code:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" the holder signs in at the issuer’s pages, in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a browser, which redirects back to the wallet’s redirect URI.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pre-authorized code:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" the issuer has already authenticated the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder, and may ask for a PIN it sent them separately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer\/txCode-swift.property","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Either way, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" then requests, checks and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stores the credentials, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/close()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends the issuance."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Receive an offer","anchor":"Receive-an-offer"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import AuthenticationServices","import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Receives the credentials an offer link offers. `askPIN` asks the","\/\/\/ holder for the PIN the issuer sent, or returns nil if they cancel;","\/\/\/ `signIn` opens the issuer's page and returns the redirect back.","func receive(offerLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             askPIN: (Offer.TxCode?) async -> String?,","             signIn: (URL) async throws -> URL) async throws -> Issuance.Result? {","    let issuance = try await wallet.startIssuance(offer: offerLink)","    switch issuance.offer.grant {","    case .preAuthorizedCode:","        while true {","            guard let pin = await askPIN(issuance.offer.txCode) else {","                try await issuance.close()","                return nil","            }","            do {","                try await issuance.redeemPreAuthorizedCode(pin: pin)","                break","            } catch let error as WalletError where error.isRetryable {","                continue \/\/ A wrong PIN (invalid_grant): ask again.","            }","        }","    case .authorizationCode:","        let url = try await issuance.beginAuthorization()","        let redirect = try await signIn(url)","        try await issuance.completeAuthorization(redirect: redirect)","    }","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/Result","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists what arrived, what the issuer deferred, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what failed: one credential the issuer refused doesn’t hold up the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Open the issuer’s page","anchor":"Open-the-issuers-page"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open the authorization URL in an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession"},{"type":"text","text":", with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redirect URI’s scheme as its callback scheme. An ephemeral session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps the issuer’s cookies out of Safari’s."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ Opens issuers' authorization pages over `window`.","@MainActor","final class IssuerSignIn: NSObject, ASWebAuthenticationPresentationContextProviding {","    private let window: ASPresentationAnchor","    private let callbackScheme: String","","    init(window: ASPresentationAnchor, callbackScheme: String) {","        self.window = window","        self.callbackScheme = callbackScheme","    }","","    nonisolated func presentationAnchor(for session: ASWebAuthenticationSession) -> ASPresentationAnchor {","        MainActor.assumeIsolated { window }","    }","","    \/\/\/ The issuer's redirect back, or `ASWebAuthenticationSessionError`","    \/\/\/ `.canceledLogin` when the holder closes the page.","    func open(_ url: URL) async throws -> URL {","        try await withCheckedThrowingContinuation { continuation in","            let session = ASWebAuthenticationSession(url: url, callbackURLScheme: callbackScheme) { redirect, error in","                if let redirect {","                    continuation.resume(returning: redirect)","                } else {","                    continuation.resume(throwing: error ?? URLError(.unknown))","                }","            }","            session.presentationContextProvider = self","            session.prefersEphemeralWebBrowserSession = true","            session.start()","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the holder closes the page, the offer stays open:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can begin again. A redirect is used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up by "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/completeAuthorization(redirect:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whatever happens,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so after a failure there, begin again rather than retrying it."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Resume after the app is killed","anchor":"Resume-after-the-app-is-killed"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS can terminate the app while the holder is at the issuer’s pages."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The authorization in progress is kept in the credential store, so when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the redirect arrives at a relaunched app, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/resumeIssuance(redirect:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completes it and returns an issuance ready for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Handle every redirect this way: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI, from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onOpenURL"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ Completes an authorization the app was killed during, from the","\/\/\/ redirect iOS delivers to the relaunched app.","func resume(redirect: URL, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> Issuance.Result {","    let issuance = try await wallet.resumeIssuance(redirect: redirect)","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A redirect that matches no authorization in progress throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/notFound"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Wait for a deferred credential","anchor":"Wait-for-a-deferred-credential"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer may issue a credential later, after a review, say. It’s kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the credential store until it’s issued, denied or abandoned, so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"survives the app quitting. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()"},{"type":"text","text":" lists them"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without network requests; poll each at the interval the issuer asks for."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ Polls a deferred credential until the issuer settles it: the","\/\/\/ credential, or a `.credentialDenied` error.","func waitFor(_ deferred: DeferredCredential, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> CredentialSummary {","    var interval = deferred.intervalSeconds","    while true {","        try await Task.sleep(for: .seconds(max(interval, 5)))","        switch try await wallet.pollDeferred(id: deferred.id) {","        case .issued(let credential): return credential","        case .pending(let next): interval = next","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/abandonDeferred(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" gives one up, deleting its keys: once"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its access token has expired, say ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential\/accessTokenExpiresAt"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Look after held credentials","anchor":"Look-after-held-credentials"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credentials()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists them, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credential(id:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns one with its claims, for display. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/display","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carries the issuer’s names, logos and colours, in the holder’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"language ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/locales","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" checks revocation against the issuer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"status list, which covers many credentials, so the issuer can’t tell"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which one is checked."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each credential arrives as a batch of copies, each bound to its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), so presentations can’t be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"linked by the credential. When "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaches zero, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" replaces them without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder, if the issuance kept a refresh token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). Otherwise it throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": receive the credential again."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deleteCredential(id:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" deletes a credential and its keys,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"revoking its refresh token at the issuer."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Offer/txCode-swift.property":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/offer\/txcode-swift.property","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer\/txCode-swift.property","kind":"symbol","title":"txCode","abstract":[{"text":"The PIN to ask the holder for, for a pre-authorized code offer.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"txCode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"TxCode","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet5OfferV6TxCodeV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/deleteCredential(id:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Deletes a credential and its holder keys, and its refresh grant"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"once no other credential uses it, first revoking the refresh token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at the Authorization Server, best effort."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deleteCredential(id:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"deleteCredential(id:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deleteCredential","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/deletecredential(id:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/DeferredCredential":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","title":"DeferredCredential","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A credential an issuer will issue later (OpenID4VCI 1.0 §9). It’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kept in the credential store until it’s issued, denied or abandoned,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so it survives the app quitting."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredCredential","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/deferredcredential","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DeferredCredential","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/reissueRequired":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired","title":"reissueRequired","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A credential can’t be refreshed: no refresh token was kept, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Authorization Server no longer accepts it. Receive it again","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from a new offer.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reissueRequired"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WalletError"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Code"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/reissuerequired","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/offer":{"abstract":[{"text":"What’s offered: show it before going on.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/offer","kind":"symbol","title":"offer","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"offer","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Offer","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet5OfferV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/offer"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"title":"OID4VCWallet","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/locales":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/locales","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/locales","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The holder’s preferred languages (BCP 47, most preferred first),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for issuers’ display metadata. ","type":"text"},{"code":"Locale.preferredLanguages","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"usual choice.","type":"text"}],"title":"locales","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"locales","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/deferredCredentials()":{"abstract":[{"text":"The credentials issuers have deferred and not yet settled, oldest","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first — including ones from before the app last quit. Makes no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"network calls: poll each at its interval.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()","kind":"symbol","title":"deferredCredentials()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deferredCredentials","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredCredential","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet18DeferredCredentialV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/deferredcredentials()"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/abandonDeferred(id:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Gives up on a deferred credential — its access token has expired,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"say, or the holder no longer wants it — deleting it and its keys."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/abandonDeferred(id:)","kind":"symbol","title":"abandonDeferred(id:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"abandonDeferred"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/abandondeferred(id:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/beginAuthorization()":{"abstract":[{"text":"Begins the authorization code grant, returning the issuer’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authorization URL to open in an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession"},{"text":". Calling it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again begins again: after the holder closed the page, say.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()","kind":"symbol","title":"beginAuthorization()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"beginAuthorization","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"URL","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/beginauthorization()"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/checkStatus(id:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fetches the issuer’s status list for a credential, checks its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signature, and returns the credential with its revocation status"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recorded. The list covers many credentials, so fetching it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t tell the issuer which one is checked. A credential without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a status list is returned as it is.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)","kind":"symbol","title":"checkStatus(id:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkStatus","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws"